  "description": "Dohwa, Hanyang's best gisaeng, abandons the life of a gisaeng and tries to run away at night with her beloved man. But it was betrayal that came back!  \n'Why did you...?'  \nWithout knowing why, Dohwa, who was murdered by his hand, fell into the cold water...  \nBut when she opened her eyes, she had become a different person?!  \n\"Madam, have I become a madam?\"'  \nHong Seo-hye, the main character of a romantic story that made a stir a in the whole city!  \n\"Oh, my God. Oh, my God. I can't believe I'm a high-class lady.'  \nFor a moment, I thought, \"Let's get rid of the lowly gisaeng bitch and be loved by handsome husband.\"  \nWhat? Is this couple different from the rumors?  \nWhere are all the stories of your romantic relationship that shook the city, and how come it's so cold?  \nAll right, I don't know what happened, but... I, Dohwa, was the best gisaeng in the world. I'll seduce my husband first!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/57453782), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/Oh-%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B4-%EC%84%9C%EB%B0%A9%EB%8B%98/2995), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/oh_my_seobangnim)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/86972)",
